{"Code":200,"Message":"operation success","MoreMessage":"","TipType":"Success","Count":195,"ReturnUrl":null,"Data":[{"Id":"a2ee78c4-efff-4e60-8bbc-d2be87cf3372","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561319649,"PostDateInt":1793584294000,"PostDate":"2026-11-02T09:51:34","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"P&E属性工程师","OrgId":99118,"Org":"整车性能及测试部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["江西省·南昌市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.负责混动及纯电车型动力系统的新技术对标研究；\n2.负责混动及纯电车型的动力性、经济性仿真分析，进行动力系统方案选型及匹配优化、混动策略设计与优化、实车与仿真对标工作；\n3.负责混动及纯电车型的开发工作：法规解读、动力经济性开发签发测试、动力性与能耗分析、问题推进、公告支持等；","Require":"1.本科及以上学历，车辆工程、机械工程、机械电子、电气工程、自动化、软件工程等相关专业；\n2.技术技能：具备以下仿真工具使用经验者优先：\n• 核心仿真工具：熟练使用 CRUISE、MATLAB/Simulink、Amesim等进行能耗仿真、控制策略开发或数据分析。\n• 辅助工具：熟悉 INCA、CANape、CANoe​、582 等标定测试工具。\n• 编程语言：掌握 Python​ 等语言用于数据处理或掌握AI能耗算法开发可作为加分项。\n3.工作经验：具备5年及以上工作经验，具备新能源汽车整车能量管理、混动标定、VCU或HCU标定工作经验者优先；\n4.综合能力：责任心强、目标驱动、有良好的逻辑思维能力和抗压能力，能协同多专业团队推进项目。","ClassificationOne":"汽车研发类","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-11-02T09:51:34","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false